OL,5,G1900 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,6,     FIn Sweden, Ben revisits Annalisa,
OL,7,     Fwho has a new partner and
OL,8,     Fhomestead. He learns of life
OL,9,     Fduring the pandemic and how they
OL,10,     Fsustain a thrifty life in a forest
OL,11,     Fwilderness.
OL,12,G2000 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,13,     FBen revisits global nomads Miriam
OL,14,     Fand Peter in the forests of the
OL,15,     FRhodope Mountains in Bulgaria, and
OL,16,     Fdiscovers dramatic events have
OL,17,     Fcaused them to change their lives.
